The Collections Ontology
------------------------

src/collections/schema/collections.yaml, src/collections_linkml/datamodel/
and project/ render the Collections Ontology (CO) 2.0 by Paolo Ciccarese
and Silvio Peroni, http://purl.org/co, which they describe in "The
Collections Ontology: creating and handling collections in OWL 2 DL
frameworks", Semantic Web 5(6), 2014, https://doi.org/10.3233/SW-130121.
The schema keeps CO's names and IRIs. Its descriptions are this
project's own words, and its use does not imply endorsement by CO's
authors.

src/collections/schema/upstream/collections.owl is CO 2.0's OWL file,
unchanged, from https://github.com/collections-ontology/collections-ontology
at commit 619e7b02646321174635fd04be658e338bf7d1d7 (git object
4e19e4892212de2b1805923a7a69fa4ba8c1b424), read on 2026-10-31. That
repository is an export of the project's Google Code site and states no
licence of its own. The Google Code archive's record of the project,
https://code.google.com/archive/p/collections-ontology, gives its
licences: the Apache License, Version 2.0 for its code and Creative
Commons Attribution 3.0 for its content. This repository copies the file
under those terms, with this credit. The file differs from the copy in
the archived Subversion trunk in one line, the address of the error
ontology it imports, which Silvio Peroni changed on GitHub in 2019.

